Lemma "user/Corollary 0b: PLL integrator equilibrium  Ki_pll*eta = -dw".
"  ==>  \forall Kppll (\forall Kipll (\forall eta (\forall dw (\forall vcqc ((((vcqc) = ((0)))&((((-((Kppll)*(vcqc)))-((Kipll)*(eta)))-(dw)) = ((0))))->(((Kipll)*(eta)) = (-(dw))))))))
\qed::ee517e7e4e4e9d5ff99380181aa899d4"
